{"demo_id": "10014_2201_12122.txt::sent::109", "doc_id": "10014_2201_12122.txt", "context_type": "sentence", "sent_idx": 136, "context_text": "By pre-training SwinTransformer on ImageNet-22k, and finetuning on downstream tasks such as detection and semantic segmentation, SwinTransfomer outperform previous state-of-the-arts models based on Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN) (Su et al., 2020).", "entities": [{"text": "pre-training", "start_token": 4304, "end_token": 4306, "start_char": 23747, "end_char": 23759, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "SwinTransformer", "start_token": 4307, "end_token": 4307, "start_char": 23760, "end_char": 23775, "ner_label": "MLModel"}, {"text": "ImageNet-22k", "start_token": 4309, "end_token": 4309, "start_char": 23779, "end_char": 23791, "ner_label": "Dataset"}, {"text": "finetuning", "start_token": 4312, "end_token": 4312, "start_char": 23797, "end_char": 23807, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "detection", "start_token": 4318, "end_token": 4318, "start_char": 23836, "end_char": 23845, "ner_label": "Task"}, {"text": "semantic segmentation", "start_token": 4320, "end_token": 4321, "start_char": 23850, "end_char": 23871, "ner_label": "Task"}, {"text": "SwinTransfomer", "start_token": 4323, "end_token": 4323, "start_char": 23873, "end_char": 23887, "ner_label": "MLModel"}, {"text": "Convolutional Neural Networks", "start_token": 4336, "end_token": 4338, "start_char": 23942, "end_char": 23971, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "CNN", "start_token": 4340, "end_token": 4340, "start_char": 23973, "end_char": 23976, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}], "labels_present": ["Dataset", "MLModel", "Method", "ModelArchitecture", "Task"]}
{"demo_id": "00045_2110_01518.txt::sent::56", "doc_id": "00045_2110_01518.txt", "context_type": "sentence", "sent_idx": 76, "context_text": "The RoBERTa-large MNLI results of our adapter implementation is on par with the recent stateof-the-art Compacter adapters on T5 (Mahabadi et al., 2021), but generalization in both BERT and RoBERTa is overall worse than with vanilla finetuning.", "entities": [{"text": "RoBERTa-large", "start_token": 1888, "end_token": 1890, "start_char": 9896, "end_char": 9909, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "MNLI", "start_token": 1891, "end_token": 1891, "start_char": 9910, "end_char": 9914, "ner_label": "Dataset"}, {"text": "adapter", "start_token": 1895, "end_token": 1895, "start_char": 9930, "end_char": 9937, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "Compacter adapters", "start_token": 1908, "end_token": 1909, "start_char": 9995, "end_char": 10013, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "T5", "start_token": 1911, "end_token": 1911, "start_char": 10017, "end_char": 10019, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "generalization", "start_token": 1922, "end_token": 1922, "start_char": 10049, "end_char": 10063, "ner_label": "Task"}, {"text": "BERT", "start_token": 1925, "end_token": 1925, "start_char": 10072, "end_char": 10076, "ner_label": "MLModel"}, {"text": "RoBERTa", "start_token": 1927, "end_token": 1927, "start_char": 10081, "end_char": 10088, "ner_label": "MLModel"}, {"text": "vanilla finetuning", "start_token": 1933, "end_token": 1934, "start_char": 10116, "end_char": 10134, "ner_label": "Method"}], "labels_present": ["Dataset", "MLModel", "Method", "ModelArchitecture", "Task"]}
{"demo_id": "10028_2003_07611.txt::sent::101", "doc_id": "10028_2003_07611.txt", "context_type": "sentence", "sent_idx": 144, "context_text": "In Figure 1, we summarize the prediction performance and reliability of the four different models-' GCN with summation readout (GCN + Sum) ', ' GCN with attention readout (GCN + Attn) ', ' GAT with summation readout (GAT + sum) ', and ' GAT with attention readout (GAT + Attn) '.", "entities": [{"text": "GCN", "start_token": 3185, "end_token": 3185, "start_char": 20419, "end_char": 20422, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "summation readout", "start_token": 3187, "end_token": 3188, "start_char": 20428, "end_char": 20445, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "GCN + Sum", "start_token": 3190, "end_token": 3192, "start_char": 20447, "end_char": 20454, "ner_label": "MLModel"}, {"text": "GCN", "start_token": 3197, "end_token": 3197, "start_char": 20459, "end_char": 20462, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "attention readout", "start_token": 3199, "end_token": 3200, "start_char": 20468, "end_char": 20485, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "GCN + Attn", "start_token": 3202, "end_token": 3204, "start_char": 20487, "end_char": 20495, "ner_label": "MLModel"}, {"text": "GAT", "start_token": 3209, "end_token": 3209, "start_char": 20500, "end_char": 20503, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "summation readout", "start_token": 3211, "end_token": 3212, "start_char": 20509, "end_char": 20526, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "GAT + sum", "start_token": 3214, "end_token": 3216, "start_char": 20528, "end_char": 20535, "ner_label": "MLModel"}, {"text": "GAT", "start_token": 3222, "end_token": 3222, "start_char": 20544, "end_char": 20547, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "attention readout", "start_token": 3224, "end_token": 3225, "start_char": 20553, "end_char": 20570, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "GAT + Attn", "start_token": 3227, "end_token": 3229, "start_char": 20572, "end_char": 20580, "ner_label": "MLModel"}], "labels_present": ["MLModel", "Method", "ModelArchitecture"]}
{"demo_id": "00044_2002_08155.txt::sent::67", "doc_id": "00044_2002_08155.txt", "context_type": "sentence", "sent_idx": 89, "context_text": "For example, in natural language code search, we feed the input as the same way as the pre-training phase and use the representation of [CLS] to measure the semantic relevance between code and natural language query, while in code-to-text generation, we use an encoderdecoder framework and initialize the encoder of a generative model with CodeBERT.", "entities": [{"text": "natural language code search", "start_token": 2657, "end_token": 2660, "start_char": 14320, "end_char": 14348, "ner_label": "Task"}, {"text": "the pre-training phase", "start_token": 2671, "end_token": 2675, "start_char": 14387, "end_char": 14409, "ner_label": "Method"}, {"text": "code-to-text generation", "start_token": 2698, "end_token": 2703, "start_char": 14530, "end_char": 14553, "ner_label": "Task"}, {"text": "encoderdecoder framework", "start_token": 2708, "end_token": 2709, "start_char": 14565, "end_char": 14589, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "encoder", "start_token": 2713, "end_token": 2713, "start_char": 14609, "end_char": 14616, "ner_label": "ModelArchitecture"}, {"text": "CodeBERT", "start_token": 2719, "end_token": 2719, "start_char": 14644, "end_char": 14652, "ner_label": "MLModel"}], "labels_present": ["MLModel", "Method", "ModelArchitecture", "Task"]}
